  {
   "ID": "card-data-plane",
   "Title": "Request path · data plane",
   "Color": "cyan",
   "Legend": false,
   "Lines": [
    "Nominal path of a user who already has a session.",
    "[1] Browser sends GET https://\u003capp\u003e-\u003cproject\u003e.3istor.com. Cloudflare terminates TLS.",
    "[2] The edge relays the request back through the app tunnel, which cloudflared opened outbound at startup. No inbound port on-prem.",
    "[3] cloudflared forwards it to Envoy over plain HTTP. Envoy matches the HTTPRoute and checks the OIDC session cookie.",
    "[4] Envoy proxies to the Service.",
    "[5] Cilium DNATs the Service VIP to an app pod.",
    "[6] The app queries its CloudNativePG cluster.",
    "Pink connections carry the OIDC login. Their order is in the OIDC sequence diagram."
   ],
   "X": 610,
   "Y": 1340,
   "W": 620,
   "H": 420
  },
  {
   "ID": "card-control-plane",
   "Title": "Background · control plane",
   "Color": "violet",
   "Legend": false,
   "Lines": [
    "[A] VSO logs in with a namespace-bound role and reads kvv2.",
    "[B] VSO writes the K8s Secret through the API server.",
    "Both cloudflared connectors open their tunnels outbound at startup.",
    "Dotted lines are object references (parentRef, targetRef, envFrom, clientSecret), not traffic."
   ],
   "X": 1260,
   "Y": 1340,
   "W": 460,
   "H": 420
  },
  {
   "ID": "card-gaps",
   "Title": "Gaps between docs and code",
   "Color": "orange",
   "Legend": false,
